msgid "abilitiesIncomplete/title"
msgstr "Combat Abilities Incomplete"

msgid "abilitiesIncomplete/toAbilities"
msgstr "To Abilities"

msgid "abilitiesIncomplete/toBattle"
msgstr "To Battle"

msgid "abilitiesIncomplete/warning"
msgstr ""
"The selected vehicle is missing one or more Combat Abilities. This could "
"significantly affect your battle performance. Enter the battle anyway?"

msgid "ammoSetup/changeHotKey/body"
msgstr ""
"You can customize the default event hotkey presets for Combat Abilities and shells.\n"
"This change applies only to event battles and will not affect any other modes.\n"
"You can still modify individual hotkeys in Menu — Settings — Controls (under Consumables)."

msgid "ammoSetup/changeHotKey/header"
msgstr "Consumable Hotkey Presets Change"

msgid "anomaliesView/description_1"
msgstr ""
"These are crew bonuses in battle. On {{@ style (color #EEEDE9B2) "
"(bold)}}Hard{{/}} and {{@ style (color #EEEDE9B2) (bold)}}Nightmare{{/}} "
"difficulties, select Anomalies during combat and combine them to unlock an "
"ultimate {{@ style (color #C293FFCC) (bold)}}Echo Anomaly{{/}}."

msgid "anomaliesView/description_2"
msgstr ""
"This guide shows the Anomalies that you have obtained in previous battles, "
"as well as those that have yet to be discovered. To open the Anomaly Menu in"
" battle, {{@ style (color #EEEDE9B2) (bold)}}press N{{/}} (default key)."

msgid "anomaliesView/header"
msgstr "ANOMALIES"

msgid "anomaliesView/quote_1/author"
msgstr ""
"—Object 66, The Quiet One\n"
"They say he was never sent on an expedition. Yet others encounter him inside the Anomaly. He hands over new notes in silence and walks away."

msgid "anomaliesView/quote_1/message"
msgstr "May the Mirium fill you."

msgid "anomaliesView/quote_2/author"
msgstr ""
"—Object 6, Pied Piper\n"
"An engineer who came back from an expedition and built the Wavebreaker. Some say the Mirium changed him. Others, that he was always like this."

msgid "anomaliesView/quote_2/message"
msgstr ""
"Can you hear it?\n"
"That's the Mirium calling."

msgid "anomaliesView/quote_3/author"
msgstr ""
"—Object 12, Magpie\n"
"A lab assistant from an early expedition, listed MIA. But she came back. Not in the right place, not at the right time, and not as the one who had left."

msgid "anomaliesView/quote_3/message"
msgstr ""
"No matter how many times you leave the Anomaly, it will keep pulling you "
"back."

msgid "anomaliesView/title"
msgstr "Anomaly Combos"

msgid "badgeWidget/tooltipBody"
msgstr ""
"Complete current mission to receive a unique Babylon: Forbidden Zone badge:"

msgid "badgeWidget/tooltipHeader"
msgstr "Epic Achievement Mission"

msgid "bestiaryView/carousel/card/new"
msgstr "NEW"

msgid "bestiaryView/carousel/card/state/locked"
msgstr "Locked"

msgid "bestiaryView/carousel/card/tooltip/locked/body"
msgstr "Complete Mission {number} to unlock the enemy's file."

msgid "bestiaryView/carousel/card/tooltip/style/body"
msgstr ""
"Take on the enemy's form in Random Battle mode with a Babylon-twisted 3D "
"style from the event store."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/czech_Cz34_Vz_71_Tesak_HW_BOT"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/france_F110_Lynx_6x6_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"A light and agile enemy capable of directing energy strikes at its targets."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/france_F17_AMX_13_90_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"A lost Hornet tank that now hunts its former allies. Its sheer hatred has "
"transformed into concentrated fire, capable of igniting enemies with every "
"single shot."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/germany_G00_Bomber_Hell"
msgstr ""
"Self-propelled black spheres, covered in spikes like naval mines. Hedgehogs "
"always appear in groups. Fast and highly maneuverable, they only deal damage"
" by exploding on impact. A single hit is dangerous. Several at once can be "
"fatal."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/germany_G00_K_bomber__HW_21_AI"
msgstr ""
"Similar to ordinary Hedgehogs in their characteristics and behavior, the "
"Alpha Hedgehog can cause even more trouble. When this thing is detected, the"
" entire squad is strongly advised to focus on destroying it."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/germany_G113_SP_I_C_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"A group of tanks bound into a single structure. Damage dealt to one is "
"shared across all of them. They stand or fall together."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/germany_G142_M48RPz_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"A standard enemy inside the Anomaly that guards the locations where Matter "
"is found. When you approach the camp, all the Guards hidden there reveal "
"themselves and attack. They are creations of Mirium and disappear without a "
"trace upon destruction."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/germany_G171_E77_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"The Monarch acts as the anchor for the Hive, sustaining every unit nearby."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/germany_G181_E100_Autocannon_Boss_HW25_bot"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/germany_G25_PzII_Luchs_HELL_HALL"
msgstr ""
"A cowardly and cautious enemy that prefers to retreat at the first sign of "
"detection. Not dangerous, but of interest as an easy target and source of "
"Mirium."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/germany_G64_Panther_II_Hall_minion"
msgstr ""
"A medium tank capable of pursuing our crews throughout the entire Anomaly. "
"Its powerful high-explosive shells can deal a considerable amount of damage "
"to low-armored allies."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/germany_G73_E50_Ausf_M_Hall_minion"
msgstr ""
"A heavy and powerful tank that tends to lead the pack of guards at camps. "
"Its immense durability and high damage output make it a lethal threat."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/italy_It19_Progetto_C50_mod_66_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"A Mirium-copied, twisted version of the Legio Ferrata, now turned against "
"its former allies with even greater power."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/uk_GB100_Manticore_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"A fast, low-profile opponent boasting high speed and durability. Infused "
"with unbreakable tracks, it carries a massive hoard of Mirium and will "
"immediately attempt to flee upon detection."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/uk_GB125_Saladin_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"This enemy carries no conventional weapons. Instead, it attempts to close "
"the distance and self-destruct, releasing a shockwave that stuns all "
"vehicles caught within its blast radius."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/uk_GB24_Centurion_Mk3_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"A Cerberus lost within the Anomaly, whose sole purpose is now to hunt down "
"those attempting to seize its Mirium."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/usa_A100_T49_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"A Lost Grenadier that can still be found within the Anomaly. Its high damage"
" output and laser guidance system make it a formidable opponent."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/ussr_R171_IS_3_II_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"A heavy tank that performs devastating ramming attacks. It usually moves "
"ahead of enemy waves and sows chaos among the team. With a successful "
"attack, it can destroy its target with a single blow."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/ussr_R40_T-54_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"A Malachite lost within the Anomaly, now extremely dangerous. Has retained "
"its original abilities and tries to get as close to you as possible."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/about/ussr_R77_KV2_turret_2"
msgstr ""
"At first glance, this may seem like an easy target, but do not be fooled. "
"Its heavy frontal armor and highly accurate gun make it a formidable threat "
"in a direct head-on engagement."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_1"
msgstr "Unable to leave the guarded area and pursue retreating vehicles."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_10"
msgstr ""
"Periodically damages all nearby vehicles with an energy wave formed in its "
"coils."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_11"
msgstr ""
"The Anomaly transformed this vehicle's gun, creating concentrated fire that "
"lets each shot ignite its target."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_12"
msgstr ""
"Fires high-explosive shells from an autoloader with a two-round magazine."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_13"
msgstr ""
"It burns away the strength of machines within its aura's radius and also "
"draws out the Matter collected by players."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_14"
msgstr ""
"Enhanced ammunition with concentrated echo energy, providing a substantial "
"damage bonus to all hits."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_15"
msgstr ""
"Creates a zone around itself. After a short delay, the zone detonates: any "
"allied vehicle caught inside is stunned. Destroy Detonator before the blast,"
" and the stun hits the surrounding echo tanks instead."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_16"
msgstr ""
"It does not move, acting as a stationary turret and hitting enemy tanks with"
" accurate fire."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_17"
msgstr ""
"Acts as a master life-link for the group, making the survival of every unit "
"dependent on this leader."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_18"
msgstr ""
"A direct link that ties this unit's core to its Monarch. When the master "
"falls, the link breaks and this unit's structure collapses moments later."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_19"
msgstr ""
"Upon destruction, this enemy leaves behind a concentrated Anomaly that, when"
" picked up, grants the team a special Pick-Up Anomaly."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_2"
msgstr ""
"Uses Charge to quickly close in on the target and ram into it, dealing "
"considerable damage."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_3"
msgstr ""
"Hunters detect enemies at large distances and shoot slow-velocity HE shells "
"from afar, which can prove extremely dangerous not only for light tanks, but"
" also for the sides and rears of mediums and even heavies."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_4"
msgstr ""
"Uses Mirium to set traps on the ground beneath its prey. These zones "
"detonate seconds later. Move or be torn apart."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_5"
msgstr "Flees at maximum speed when detected, carrying Mirium away with it."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_6"
msgstr ""
"Locks onto the nearest target and charges at full speed, detonating on "
"impact. The blast can also damage nearby vehicles."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_7"
msgstr ""
"Once destroyed, the Alpha Hedgehog shatters into several regular Hedgehogs "
"(usually three, but numbers may vary), which will chase the closest ally, "
"ram it, and explode."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_8"
msgstr ""
"Emits a Mirium aura that corrodes the armor of nearby vehicles, absorbing "
"the lost material to restore itself."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/description/ability_9"
msgstr ""
"Its weapon's increased rate of fire allows this enemy to inflict extra "
"damage."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/czech_Cz34_Vz_71_Tesak_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"{UL}tacticalAdvise_czech_Cz34_Vz_71_Tesak_HW_BOT "
"{UL}{LI}{f7f6f299Bold_open}Tactic_1{f7f6f299Bold_close}: "
"do_1.{UL}{LI}{f7f6f299Bold_open}Tactic_2{f7f6f299Bold_close}: "
"do_2.{UL}{LI}{f7f6f299Bold_open}Tactic_3{f7f6f299Bold_close}: do_3 ."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/france_F110_Lynx_6x6_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"{UL}It won't let you complete the mission in peace! Focus on destroying the "
"Trapper first.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Spread out{{/}}: If an ally is too "
"close, you might end up in their damage zone while trying to escape your "
"own.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Avoid narrow passages{{/}}: Maintain maximum "
"maneuverability.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Use vehicle abilities{{/}}: Shield"
" will protect you from zone damage, while Stealth prevents the Trapper from "
"targeting you in the first place. However, keep in mind that Stealth won't "
"help if you're already inside a damage zone."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/france_F17_AMX_13_90_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Count the shells, it has one for each of your team!{UL}{LI}{{@ style "
"(bold)}}High-priority target{{/}}: Due to its anomalous abilities, this tank"
" poses a significant threat to the entire team.{UL}{LI}{{@ style "
"(bold)}}Tactics triumph{{/}}: Stealth and Group Repair can extinguish fire "
"and help you or your allies not burn down completely.{UL}{LI}{{@ style "
"(bold)}}Burst it down{{/}}: Use Turbo to ram it in one swift blow!"

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/germany_G00_Bomber_Hell"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Once detected, Hedgehogs should become the team's top "
"priority!{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Vulnerability{{/}}: Their lack of armor "
"makes them extremely easy to destroy with any weapon.{UL}{LI}{{@ style "
"(bold)}}Group tactics{{/}}: These enemies usually attack in swarms, so stay "
"alert and don't let them surprise you.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}AOE "
"advantage{{/}}: Use area-of-effect abilities like Energy Shot or Vampiric "
"Shot to destroy the entire cluster in one blow."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/germany_G00_K_bomber__HW_21_AI"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Once you’ve dealt with the Alpha, be ready to deal with the regular "
"Hedgehogs!{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Area damage{{/}}: Use your Combat "
"Abilities—a single AOE strike can be enough to destroy the whole group in "
"one go.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Shield timing{{/}}: Use your Energy Shield "
"to absorb damage from ramming Hedgehogs, but time it carefully so it's "
"active right before they reach you.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Stay "
"mobile{{/}}: If your vehicle is fragile, use your speed and turbo to "
"outmaneuver the swarm and pick them off from a safe distance."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/germany_G113_SP_I_C_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Four heads, one core.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Shared structure{{/}}: "
"Every shot counts, regardless of which tank you hit. Damaging any unit in "
"the cluster wears down their shared structure.{UL}{LI}{{@ style "
"(bold)}}Constant firepower{{/}}: Because they share a single structure, you "
"cannot reduce their firepower by destroying individual units early—all keep "
"firing until the last one falls.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Maximize "
"profit{{/}}: Ensure you fully eliminate the entire Hive to fill the "
"collector and harvest more Mirium."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/germany_G142_M48RPz_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Within the Anomaly, teamwork is the key to success.{UL}{LI}{{@ style "
"(bold)}}Coordinate the attack{{/}}: Only attack the camp with a joint "
"strike, never alone!{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Gun advantage{{/}}: A "
"destroyed enemy can't cause damage. Do not leave any survivors "
"behind.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Tactical retreat{{/}}: If there is a risk "
"of destruction, you can retreat beyond the camp to save the vehicle."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/germany_G171_E77_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Sever the head, and the body will fall!{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Strike "
"the heart{{/}}: Use your Turbo to break through the swarm and eliminate the "
"Monarch.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Easy target{{/}}: The Monarch itself is "
"not a difficult opponent to destroy.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Strategic "
"choice{{/}}: Pick your priority—kill the Monarch to end the fight "
"immediately, or clear the Hive tanks first to fill the collector and harvest"
" more Mirium."

msgid ""
"bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/germany_G181_E100_Autocannon_Boss_HW25_bot"
msgstr ""
"{UL}tacticalAdvise_germany_G181_E100_Autocannon_Boss_HW25_bot "
"{UL}{LI}{f7f6f299Bold_open}Tactic_1{f7f6f299Bold_close}: "
"do_1.{UL}{LI}{f7f6f299Bold_open}Tactic_2{f7f6f299Bold_close}: "
"do_2.{UL}{LI}{f7f6f299Bold_open}Tactic_3{f7f6f299Bold_close}: do_3 ."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/germany_G25_PzII_Luchs_HELL_HALL"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Don’t let them escape!{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Low survivability{{/}}: "
"Can be destroyed in just one or two hits, even with low-power "
"guns.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Prioritize distant Rabbits{{/}}: Don’t let "
"them slip away. Shoot their tracks if needed.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Use "
"Turbo{{/}}: This ability will help you chase down a fleeing Rabbit or "
"destroy it with minor ramming impact."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/germany_G64_Panther_II_Hall_minion"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Hunters will pursue you across the entire map, so retreating is not an "
"option.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Stay alert{{/}}: Engage the Hunters once "
"you have dealt with the main enemy forces or before starting a new "
"encounter.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Stay on the move{{/}}: You can dodge "
"slow-moving HE shells by staying mobile.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Shell "
"fireworks{{/}}: The Hunter's sides are a direct storage area for their "
"vulnerable and explosive shells—aim there."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/germany_G73_E50_Ausf_M_Hall_minion"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Big and clumsy, use that to your advantage!{UL}{LI}{{@ style "
"(bold)}}High profile{{/}}: Try to get close and to the side of the enemy, "
"keep yourself under its gun.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Use the terrain{{/}}: "
"Take advantage of the environment. Standing in the open against its massive "
"cannon is a fatal mistake.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Coordinated strike{{/}}:"
" Because of its huge durability, think twice before trying to take it down "
"alone."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/header"
msgstr "Tactical Advice"

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/italy_It19_Progetto_C50_mod_66_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"{UL}This echo-copy will restore itself through your mistakes!{UL}{LI}{{@ "
"style (bold)}}High-priority target{{/}}: Due to its anomalous abilities, "
"this tank poses an extreme threat to the entire team.{UL}{LI}{{@ style "
"(bold)}}Keep your distance{{/}}: This enemy is much harder to destroy if it "
"repairs itself at your expense.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Avoid a duel{{/}}: "
"This corrupted copy can easily take out your tank in a one-on-one encounter."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/uk_GB100_Manticore_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Catch it while you can—there are no second chances to gain an "
"advantage!{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}One-time opportunity{{/}}: The Scavenger"
" carries a large amount of Mirium and a unique Anomaly. If you lose it, both"
" the Scavenger and its valuable goods vanish for the remainder of the "
"battle.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Ignore the tracks{{/}}: This enemy has "
"invulnerable tracks. Use damage-boosting abilities to burn through its armor"
" instead.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Watch your back{{/}}: Don't let other "
"enemies catch you off guard while you are distracted by the chase."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/uk_GB125_Saladin_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Stay back and destroy it—fast!{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Keep your "
"distance{{/}}: Do not let the Detonator get close.{UL}{LI}{{@ style "
"(bold)}}Turn the tide{{/}}: If you destroy the Detonator before it self-"
"destructs, its shockwave will stun all enemy tanks in the area.{UL}{LI}{{@ "
"style (bold)}}Ready your repairs{{/}}: If you or your allies are caught in "
"the blast, use Group Repair to immediately clear the stun effect."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/uk_GB24_Centurion_Mk3_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Don't let it catch you in the open!{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}High-"
"priority target{{/}}: Due to its anomalous abilities, this tank poses an "
"extreme threat to the entire team.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Tactics "
"triumph{{/}}: When engaging this opponent, keep your shield or stealth ready"
" to negate its high damage output.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Fight fire with "
"fire{{/}}: Use your Fast Reload ability to burn through its armor and "
"eliminate this pale imitation of a real Cerberus as quickly as possible."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/usa_A100_T49_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"{UL}One wrong move and you're out!{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}High-priority "
"target{{/}}: Due to its anomalous abilities, this tank poses a significant "
"threat to the entire team.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Low armor{{/}}: Load HE "
"shells to deal with it faster.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Flanking enemy{{/}}:"
" Don't let this enemy flank your team. Face it head on."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/ussr_R171_IS_3_II_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Destroy the battering ram before it hits! This is a priority target in "
"any wave.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Shoot at the tracks{{/}}: This will "
"immobilize the Charger and make it an easy target for your "
"allies.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Concentrate your fire{{/}}: Destroy the "
"enemy before it recovers. If necessary, shoot down the tracks "
"again.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Avoid ramming{{/}}: If the Charger breaks "
"through to you, activate invisibility or perform sharp maneuvers to get out "
"of the line of attack."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/ussr_R40_T-54_HW_BOT"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Keep your eyes open, because it'll be at close range before you know "
"it.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}High-priority target{{/}}: Due to its anomalous"
" abilities, this tank poses a significant threat to the entire "
"team.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Keep your distance{{/}}: This enemy emits a "
"damaging energy field. Any unit caught within the radius takes significant "
"damage.{UL}{LI}{{@ style (bold)}}Burst it down{{/}}: Use Fast Reload or "
"other tactics to bring it down before it gets too close."

msgid "bestiaryView/info/tacticalAdvise/ussr_R77_KV2_turret_2"
msgstr ""
"{UL}Stay mobile and stay out of the "
"crossfire!{UL}{LI}{f7f6f299Bold_open}Stationary Threat{f7f6f299Bold_close}: "
"Since this opponent cannot move, use the environment to your advantage. "
"Utilize hills and obstacles to break its line of sight and avoid incoming "
"fire.{UL}{LI}{f7f6f299Bold_open}Don't Duel Head-on{f7f6f299Bold_close}: Its "
"frontal plating is exceptionally thick. Instead of trading shots, look for a"
" way to flank it or wait for an opening to strike its more vulnerable "
"sides.{UL}{LI}{f7f6f299Bold_open}Ready Your Shields{f7f6f299Bold_close}: "
"This enemy packs a punch. Its high-damage shells can cripple your vehicle, "
"so keep your Energy Shield ready to mitigate the damage."

